        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Plantasia is a cozy semi-idle, gardening game designed to sit at the bottom 1/3 of your screen so you can play in-between tasks without disrupting your work!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3236330/extras/dad649cc1698fa6117a89d1b4f2e5715.avif?t=1757368891\" width=800 height=450 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Multitasking</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Plantasia is designed to encourage play during small breaks, without disrupting your regular workflow as you transition in and out of other tasks. The game rests on the very bottom of your screen, allowing you space to work and play at the same time.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Nurture Plants</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Plant your seeds and watch them grow into beautiful blooms. Then, harvest them for materials and extra seeds.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3236330/extras/0e19df90a3068e8316006df6756b6e87.avif?t=1757368891\" width=1560 height=292 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Combine Species</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Combine two different seeds in the lab to create Hybrid seeds. Discover new species and colors and grow new interesting plant types for better appearances and resource yields.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3236330/extras/4d7620a1ea4d41de7f6d6704fcf15da4.avif?t=1757368891\" width=1560 height=290 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Create Seed Bundles</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your fellow REVIVE representatives need your help! Occasionally they will request Seed Bundles. The bundles will help you complete quests and acquire new materials needed to expand and customize your Greenhouse!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3236330/extras/eed879ebd10a70456e7c7215b4ba94d8.avif?t=1757368891\" width=1560 height=289 /></span> </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Decorate Your Bedroom</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Relax in style in your completely customizable Bedroom, making sure that you can make it as cozy as possible. After all, home is where the plants are.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock decor in your bedroom by crafting. Use the resources you collect while growing plants and create a cozy bedroom in different color schemes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3236330/extras/616b3ff5af8c18490d84ec4757b4df5c.avif?t=1757368891\" width=1560 height=290 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Seed Bank: Complete your Seed Database</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >One of the functionalities available in the Seed Bank room is the Seed Database. Here, you can see which plants you have discovered, which plants are unknown, and details about the plant species and gene traits.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3236330/extras/0a8e9114011d2a34f04e775702f97e48.avif?t=1757368891\" width=1560 height=294 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Seed Bank: Purchase Seeds in the Seed Store</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The second tab in the Seed Bank is a Seed Store. Use in game currency to buy seeds of a specific species that you have already unlocked. Undiscovered seeds aren’t available for purchase.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3236330/extras/304a19c793081b282c12bb43cc9936a2.avif?t=1757368891\" width=1560 height=294 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Seed Bank: The Seed Shuffler</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The seed shuffler is a scientific device that shuffles seed DNA to create new types of seeds. Use in game currency to power the device and if you are lucky you may unlock never before discovered seeds. The shuffler is also great for discovering new or improved Gene Traits.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3236330/extras/cdc291a792a61fa1d3fcda745a000ae1.avif?t=1757368891\" width=1560 height=291 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Gene Traits</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Plants have random Gene Traits – traits that change many aspects of the seeds growth, output or needs. You can view all Gene Traits in the Seed Database. Cross-breeding plants will also take Gene Traits into account. Gene Traits are a high level mechanic, and intended for players who want to deeply customize their growing experience. Casual players do not need to interact with this system in order to achieve their goals.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3236330/extras/8e94f0848d10c1ebb80fcb80e26d32b2.avif?t=1757368891\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3236330/extras_big/8e94f0848d10c1ebb80fcb80e26d32b2.webp?t=1757368891 width=1560 height=292 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3236330/extras/ea3c3c3f18130174535ed8731aea6658.avif?t=1757368891\" width=600 height=150 /></span></p>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Plantasia is a cozy semi-idle, gardening game designed to sit at the bottom 1/3 of your screen so you can play in-between tasks without disrupting your work!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3236330/extras/dad649cc1698fa6117a89d1b4f2e5715.avif?t=1757368891\" width=800 height=450 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Multitasking</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Plantasia is designed to encourage play during small breaks, without disrupting your regular workflow as you transition in and out of other tasks. The game rests on the very bottom of your screen, allowing you space to work and play at the same time.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Nurture Plants</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Plant your seeds and watch them grow into beautiful blooms. Then, harvest them for materials and extra seeds.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3236330/extras/0e19df90a3068e8316006df6756b6e87.avif?t=1757368891\" width=1560 height=292 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Combine Species</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Combine two different seeds in the lab to create Hybrid seeds. Discover new species and colors and grow new interesting plant types for better appearances and resource yields.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3236330/extras/4d7620a1ea4d41de7f6d6704fcf15da4.avif?t=1757368891\" width=1560 height=290 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Create Seed Bundles</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your fellow REVIVE representatives need your help! Occasionally they will request Seed Bundles. The bundles will help you complete quests and acquire new materials needed to expand and customize your Greenhouse!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3236330/extras/eed879ebd10a70456e7c7215b4ba94d8.avif?t=1757368891\" width=1560 height=289 /></span> </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Decorate Your Bedroom</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Relax in style in your completely customizable Bedroom, making sure that you can make it as cozy as possible. After all, home is where the plants are.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock decor in your bedroom by crafting. Use the resources you collect while growing plants and create a cozy bedroom in different color schemes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3236330/extras/616b3ff5af8c18490d84ec4757b4df5c.avif?t=1757368891\" width=1560 height=290 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Seed Bank: Complete your Seed Database</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >One of the functionalities available in the Seed Bank room is the Seed Database. Here, you can see which plants you have discovered, which plants are unknown, and details about the plant species and gene traits.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3236330/extras/0a8e9114011d2a34f04e775702f97e48.avif?t=1757368891\" width=1560 height=294 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Seed Bank: Purchase Seeds in the Seed Store</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The second tab in the Seed Bank is a Seed Store. Use in game currency to buy seeds of a specific species that you have already unlocked. Undiscovered seeds aren’t available for purchase.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3236330/extras/304a19c793081b282c12bb43cc9936a2.avif?t=1757368891\" width=1560 height=294 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Seed Bank: The Seed Shuffler</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The seed shuffler is a scientific device that shuffles seed DNA to create new types of seeds. Use in game currency to power the device and if you are lucky you may unlock never before discovered seeds. The shuffler is also great for discovering new or improved Gene Traits.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3236330/extras/cdc291a792a61fa1d3fcda745a000ae1.avif?t=1757368891\" width=1560 height=291 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Gene Traits</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Plants have random Gene Traits – traits that change many aspects of the seeds growth, output or needs. You can view all Gene Traits in the Seed Database. Cross-breeding plants will also take Gene Traits into account. Gene Traits are a high level mechanic, and intended for players who want to deeply customize their growing experience. Casual players do not need to interact with this system in order to achieve their goals.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3236330/extras/8e94f0848d10c1ebb80fcb80e26d32b2.avif?t=1757368891\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3236330/extras_big/8e94f0848d10c1ebb80fcb80e26d32b2.webp?t=1757368891 width=1560 height=292 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3236330/extras/ea3c3c3f18130174535ed8731aea6658.avif?t=1757368891\" width=600 height=150 /></span></p>",
